  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Update dependency typescript-eslint to v8.72.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/219\n* Update Slack notifications to use the shared notify-slack action by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/220\n* Show expandable values in the viewer's Instance Context panel by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/221\n* Update dependency vite to v8.3.5 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/222\n* Update dependency node to v24.22.1 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/223\n* Update dependency python to v3.15.1 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/224\n* Update actions/setup-python digest to 6d4fd22 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/226\n* Highlight all join arrival edges and show Fork/Join badges in WorkflowViewer (#227) by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/228\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/compare/v3.0.3...v3.0.4",
